@startuml advisory_graph
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

state "profile" as profile : seed / complete\nstudent profile
state "retrieve" as retrieve : query canonical store\n(programs, cutoffs)
state "conflict" as conflict : detect contradictions,\nLLM tiebreaker
state "reason" as reason : eligibility checks,\nranked recommendations
state "policy" as policy : admission-regulation\ngate
state "explain" as explain : grounded answer\nwith citations

[*] --> profile
profile --> retrieve
retrieve --> conflict
conflict --> reason
reason --> policy
policy --> explain
explain --> [*]

note bottom of conflict
  Every node is wrapped by
  traced(stage, seq, extractor):
  per-stage events are persisted to
  advisory_trace_events for the
  debug panel.
end note
@enduml
